[{"start": 0.75, "end": 2.75, "text": "正好,你们几个都在。"}, {"start": 5.06, "end": 7.06, "text": "今日我顺便出个题目考考你们。"}, {"start": 8.06, "end": 9.06, "text": "请父亲试一下。"}, {"start": 10.06, "end": 13.06, "text": "眼下,刺客肯定还在许昌城中。"}, {"start": 14.06, "end": 18.06, "text": "你们说说,我该如何应对这些刺客。"}, {"start": 19.06, "end": 21.06, "text": "而认为应该马上封锁城门。"}, {"start": 22.06, "end": 24.06, "text": "挨家挨户去搜查,而亲待五百甲士。"}, {"start": 25.06, "end": 28.06, "text": "天黑之前,必定把刺客碎尸万段。"}, {"start": 29.06, "end": 31.06, "text": "此外,还应该发布告示,"}, {"start": 31.06, "end": 34.06, "text": "让他们赔偿千金,动员全城百姓一起拿贼。"}, {"start": 35.06, "end": 38.06, "text": "这样才能使贼子们无安身之处。"}, {"start": 40.5, "end": 43.5, "text": "三弟,四弟,说得是。"}, {"start": 44.5, "end": 47.5, "text": "我建议大开城门,放刺客逃生。"}, {"start": 53.63, "end": 57.63, "text": "那你说说,为何要放刺客逃生啊?"}, {"start": 58.63, "end": 60.63, "text": "刺客们已经行刺失败,杀了他们也没用。"}, {"start": 61.63, "end": 64.63, "text": "反可以让他们把父亲回城的消息带给马腾。"}, {"start": 64.63, "end": 66.63, "text": "让他反战新京。"}, {"start": 69.63, "end": 73.62, "text": "说得好,说得太好。"}, {"start": 74.62, "end": 80.47, "text": "你们几个,怎么就不能如此想问题了?"}, {"start": 81.47, "end": 84.47, "text": "光知道把人碎尸万段,又有何用?"}, {"start": 85.47, "end": 87.47, "text": "记住,不要愤怒。"}, {"start": 88.47, "end": 90.47, "text": "愤怒,会降低你的智慧。"}, {"start": 91.47, "end": 93.47, "text": "也不要恨自个儿的敌人。"}, {"start": 94.47, "end": 98.47, "text": "因为仇恨,会使你丧失判断力。"}, {"start": 99.47, "end": 105.72, "text": "与其恨自个儿的敌人,不如拿它来为我所用。"}, {"start": 106.72, "end": 111.62, "text": "儿臣明白。"}, {"start": 111.62, "end": 112.62, "text": "明白。"}, {"start": 112.62, "end": 158.38, "text": "丞相,丞相,丞相。"}, {"start": 158.38, "end": 160.38, "text": "你先别说,让我猜猜。"}, {"start": 161.38, "end": 163.38, "text": "好,请丞相猜。"}, {"start": 164.38, "end": 166.38, "text": "马腾和韩遂撤兵了吧?"}, {"start": 166.38, "end": 168.38, "text": "丞相为何以猜忌众?正是。"}, {"start": 169.38, "end": 175.42, "text": "这有何难?马腾不过是一介莽夫。"}, {"start": 176.42, "end": 180.42, "text": "他看我赤壁战败,想在我回独之前偷袭许昌。"}, {"start": 181.42, "end": 183.42, "text": "所以才星夜兴兵南下。"}, {"start": 184.42, "end": 189.42, "text": "他没有料到我已经搬势回城了,所以也就无计可施了。"}, {"start": 190.42, "end": 195.96, "text": "到今日,他带着十万大军出来也有三十天了吧?"}, {"start": 196.96, "end": 197.96, "text": "是的。"}, {"start": 197.96, "end": 198.96, "text": "他能带多少粮草?"}, {"start": 199.96, "end": 202.96, "text": "再不回西凉,他吃什么?"}, {"start": 203.96, "end": 206.96, "text": "丞相之事,在下无体头顶。"}, {"start": 207.96, "end": 221.08, "text": "从赤壁以来,我一直心神不宁。"}, {"start": 222.08, "end": 223.08, "text": "这下好了。"}, {"start": 224.08, "end": 226.08, "text": "我们都可以喊口气了。"}, {"start": 227.08, "end": 229.08, "text": "公子赵王,都退下。"}, {"start": 240.51, "end": 247.34, "text": "先生认识司马姨吗?"}, {"start": 247.34, "end": 260.46, "text": "八岁前,我与她比邻而居,天天斗计宰狗。"}, {"start": 260.46, "end": 264.46, "text": "十八岁前,我与她同门,施从南山先生。"}, {"start": 265.46, "end": 267.46, "text": "学习古今兵法,阴阳异理。"}, {"start": 268.46, "end": 270.46, "text": "二十八岁,我投效于丞相。"}, {"start": 270.46, "end": 272.46, "text": "他则云游四海,先宗不定。"}, {"start": 273.46, "end": 275.46, "text": "父亲把她招入东府了?"}, {"start": 276.46, "end": 279.22, "text": "重达入阁了?"}, {"start": 280.22, "end": 282.22, "text": "真是可喜可贺,可惊可态。"}, {"start": 283.22, "end": 286.7, "text": "先生,我都知道了。"}, {"start": 286.7, "end": 289.7, "text": "我与司马姨相比,有如凡星笔号月。"}, {"start": 290.7, "end": 292.7, "text": "她的才能胜我十倍。"}, {"start": 292.7, "end": 296.7, "text": "其智,其识,其狠,以及奸人老辣,"}, {"start": 296.7, "end": 298.7, "text": "都不在孔明周瑜之下。"}, {"start": 299.7, "end": 301.7, "text": "我与司马姨相比,"}, {"start": 301.7, "end": 305.23, "text": "有如凡星笔号月。"}, {"start": 306.23, "end": 308.23, "text": "她的才能胜我十倍。"}, {"start": 308.23, "end": 312.23, "text": "其智,其识,其狠,以及奸人老辣,"}, {"start": 312.23, "end": 314.23, "text": "都不在孔明周瑜之下。"}, {"start": 314.23, "end": 316.23, "text": "她的才能胜我十倍。"}, {"start": 316.23, "end": 318.23, "text": "她的才能胜我十倍。"}, {"start": 318.23, "end": 320.23, "text": "她的才能胜我十倍。"}, {"start": 320.23, "end": 322.23, "text": "她的才能胜我十倍。"}, {"start": 323.23, "end": 325.23, "text": "bidding"}, {"start": 326.23, "end": 328.23, "text": "在何地?"}, {"start": 333.23, "end": 335.23, "text": "中âte"}, {"start": 339.23, "end": 340.23, "text": "中????"}, {"start": 340.23, "end": 341.23, "text": "中????"}, {"start": 341.23, "end": 342.23, "text": "中 مش"}, {"start": 342.23, "end": 343.23, "text": "中。。。"}, {"start": 343.23, "end": 347.23, "text": "其兄弟子嗣也堪称一时之俊杰"}, {"start": 347.23, "end": 349.23, "text": "我听说他有两个小儿"}, {"start": 349.23, "end": 351.23, "text": "各个聪明无比"}, {"start": 351.23, "end": 352.23, "text": "尤其长子司马昭"}, {"start": 352.23, "end": 356.23, "text": "三岁时就能把一步春秋倒背如流"}, {"start": 356.23, "end": 357.23, "text": "公子"}, {"start": 357.23, "end": 359.23, "text": "你一定好好笼入此人"}, {"start": 359.23, "end": 361.23, "text": "最好把他收入账下"}, {"start": 361.23, "end": 363.23, "text": "得司马仪一人"}, {"start": 363.23, "end": 366.23, "text": "等于得到北方士族的支持"}, {"start": 366.23, "end": 367.23, "text": "父亲"}, {"start": 367.23, "end": 376.73, "text": "你已经让他做了曹冲的师父了"}, {"start": 376.73, "end": 380.81, "text": "让司马仪辅佐少公子"}, {"start": 380.81, "end": 381.81, "text": "是啊"}, {"start": 384.82, "end": 385.82, "text": "是啊"}, {"start": 386.82, "end": 388.82, "text": "先生知道这意味着什么吗"}, {"start": 388.82, "end": 389.82, "text": "这意味着"}, {"start": 389.82, "end": 395.6, "text": "丞相要立少公子为世子"}, {"start": 395.6, "end": 397.6, "text": "承继大业"}, {"start": 397.6, "end": 401.1, "text": "岂止如此"}, {"start": 401.1, "end": 403.1, "text": "父亲如果立了"}, {"start": 403.1, "end": 404.1, "text": "冲帝为储"}, {"start": 404.1, "end": 406.1, "text": "继承大业"}, {"start": 406.1, "end": 407.1, "text": "那我"}, {"start": 407.1, "end": 411.51, "text": "不就成了冲帝的威胁了吗"}, {"start": 411.51, "end": 415.72, "text": "父亲临终前"}, {"start": 415.72, "end": 417.72, "text": "为确保冲帝太平"}, {"start": 417.72, "end": 422.95, "text": "会留着我这个兄长吗"}, {"start": 422.95, "end": 426.78, "text": "公子所虑极是"}, {"start": 426.78, "end": 427.78, "text": "求先生救我"}, {"start": 431.4, "end": 432.4, "text": "求先生救我"}, {"start": 433.4, "end": 434.4, "text": "如何救"}, {"start": 434.4, "end": 435.4, "text": "请公子吩咐"}, {"start": 436.4, "end": 437.4, "text": "先生"}, {"start": 437.4, "end": 439.4, "text": "您与司马仪有宗教之交"}, {"start": 439.4, "end": 440.4, "text": "探探考验"}, {"start": 443.1, "end": 445.1, "text": "看看父亲给他交代了什么"}, {"start": 445.1, "end": 447.1, "text": "他又如何去做"}, {"start": 447.1, "end": 448.1, "text": "之后"}, {"start": 448.1, "end": 449.1, "text": "我再"}, {"start": 450.1, "end": 451.1, "text": "相机行事"}, {"start": 451.1, "end": 452.1, "text": "陈群"}, {"start": 498.42, "end": 499.42, "text": "掌门兄"}, {"start": 500.42, "end": 501.42, "text": "仲达"}, {"start": 501.42, "end": 502.42, "text": "入阁多日"}, {"start": 502.42, "end": 504.42, "text": "竟不来看看于兄"}, {"start": 505.42, "end": 506.42, "text": "无奈"}, {"start": 506.42, "end": 508.42, "text": "我只好登门拜你了"}, {"start": 509.42, "end": 510.42, "text": "多有得罪"}, {"start": 510.42, "end": 511.42, "text": "多有得罪"}, {"start": 511.42, "end": 514.43, "text": "我听说贤兄"}, {"start": 514.43, "end": 515.43, "text": "在青州蜀崖"}, {"start": 515.43, "end": 517.43, "text": "担当刺史大任"}, {"start": 517.43, "end": 519.43, "text": "何时回相府来了"}, {"start": 519.43, "end": 522.96, "text": "旧疾又犯"}, {"start": 523.96, "end": 525.96, "text": "只好回徐昌养病"}, {"start": 526.96, "end": 527.96, "text": "仲达"}, {"start": 528.96, "end": 530.96, "text": "咱们云梦山一别"}, {"start": 530.96, "end": 532.96, "text": "有十年没见了吧"}, {"start": 532.96, "end": 533.96, "text": "整整十年"}, {"start": 533.96, "end": 536.59, "text": "好啊"}, {"start": 538.94, "end": 539.94, "text": "有贤兄在这"}, {"start": 539.94, "end": 540.94, "text": "在下就不寂寞了"}, {"start": 542.94, "end": 543.94, "text": "贤兄快坐"}, {"start": 544.94, "end": 545.94, "text": "好"}, {"start": 545.94, "end": 546.94, "text": "请"}, {"start": 546.94, "end": 547.94, "text": "看察"}, {"start": 547.94, "end": 552.33, "text": "诺"}, {"start": 552.33, "end": 564.38, "text": "你不是一直青高碧视吗"}, {"start": 565.38, "end": 567.38, "text": "为何出山为官呢"}, {"start": 567.38, "end": 574.37, "text": "丞相制下眼令"}, {"start": 574.37, "end": 576.37, "text": "要么扶持台岸"}, {"start": 576.37, "end": 578.37, "text": "要么扛我头颅"}, {"start": 578.37, "end": 579.37, "text": "你知道的"}, {"start": 580.37, "end": 581.37, "text": "我一怕疼"}, {"start": 581.37, "end": 582.37, "text": "二怕苦"}, {"start": 582.37, "end": 583.37, "text": "三还怕死"}, {"start": 583.37, "end": 584.37, "text": "无奈"}, {"start": 584.37, "end": 585.37, "text": "只好应命了"}, {"start": 587.37, "end": 588.37, "text": "好"}, {"start": 588.37, "end": 589.37, "text": "好"}, {"start": 589.37, "end": 591.37, "text": "得司马一为辅"}, {"start": 591.37, "end": 593.37, "text": "丞相大业必成"}, {"start": 593.37, "end": 594.37, "text": "仲达"}, {"start": 594.37, "end": 596.37, "text": "你我故交"}, {"start": 596.37, "end": 598.37, "text": "说话就不绕弯了"}, {"start": 598.37, "end": 600.37, "text": "听说你一来"}, {"start": 600.37, "end": 602.37, "text": "丞相就托于大任"}, {"start": 602.37, "end": 603.37, "text": "对吗"}, {"start": 604.37, "end": 605.37, "text": "贤兄是不是"}, {"start": 605.37, "end": 606.37, "text": "有话要问"}, {"start": 606.37, "end": 607.37, "text": "请指教"}, {"start": 609.37, "end": 610.37, "text": "你看"}, {"start": 610.37, "end": 612.37, "text": "十年不见"}, {"start": 612.37, "end": 614.37, "text": "你一发的狡猾"}, {"start": 614.37, "end": 616.37, "text": "我还没有问你"}, {"start": 616.37, "end": 618.37, "text": "你倒先防上我了"}, {"start": 619.37, "end": 621.37, "text": "断断不干"}, {"start": 622.37, "end": 624.37, "text": "贤兄如有话说"}, {"start": 624.37, "end": 625.37, "text": "便请直寻"}, {"start": 625.37, "end": 627.37, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 627.37, "end": 634.17, "text": "叫你当曹冲的师父了"}, {"start": 635.17, "end": 636.17, "text": "是"}, {"start": 636.17, "end": 638.17, "text": "那丞相的心思"}, {"start": 641.15, "end": 645.98, "text": "是想让曹冲当世子了"}, {"start": 645.98, "end": 646.98, "text": "明白了"}, {"start": 646.98, "end": 652.4, "text": "少公子得天倦哪"}, {"start": 660.34, "end": 664.74, "text": "说实的"}, {"start": 665.74, "end": 667.74, "text": "诸公子中"}, {"start": 667.74, "end": 669.74, "text": "就属他聪明"}, {"start": 670.74, "end": 672.74, "text": "前途无量啊"}, {"start": 672.74, "end": 673.74, "text": "不对"}, {"start": 673.74, "end": 674.74, "text": "怎么"}, {"start": 675.74, "end": 681.42, "text": "曹冲不是聪明的公子"}, {"start": 682.42, "end": 684.42, "text": "真正聪明的公子"}, {"start": 684.42, "end": 685.42, "text": "应该让人"}, {"start": 685.42, "end": 686.42, "text": "看不出他的聪明"}, {"start": 687.42, "end": 688.42, "text": "那依你说"}, {"start": 689.42, "end": 693.08, "text": "他不是聪明的公子"}, {"start": 693.08, "end": 694.08, "text": "你说"}, {"start": 695.08, "end": 696.08, "text": "谁比他更聪明"}, {"start": 697.08, "end": 699.74, "text": "有一个"}, {"start": 699.74, "end": 700.74, "text": "外表憨厚"}, {"start": 700.74, "end": 702.74, "text": "内心坚忍的公子"}, {"start": 702.74, "end": 704.74, "text": "就比少公子聪明"}, {"start": 711.34, "end": 712.34, "text": "比方说"}, {"start": 712.34, "end": 714.34, "text": "贤兄今日来访"}, {"start": 714.34, "end": 716.34, "text": "八成就是他的意思"}, {"start": 720.42, "end": 725.85, "text": "十年不见"}, {"start": 726.85, "end": 729.85, "text": "你叫我是越来越害怕了"}, {"start": 729.85, "end": 737.93, "text": "贤兄用茶"}, {"start": 737.93, "end": 738.93, "text": "待会儿"}, {"start": 739.93, "end": 740.93, "text": "我们一起"}, {"start": 740.93, "end": 741.93, "text": "鼓乐为乐"}, {"start": 741.93, "end": 742.93, "text": "可否"}, {"start": 743.93, "end": 744.93, "text": "好"}, {"start": 745.93, "end": 746.93, "text": "好"}, {"start": 747.93, "end": 748.93, "text": "请问"}, {"start": 748.93, "end": 750.93, "text": "足下琴艺可有进一"}, {"start": 751.93, "end": 753.93, "text": "正要贤兄教诲"}, {"start": 755.93, "end": 757.93, "text": "如论知兵知人"}, {"start": 758.93, "end": 759.93, "text": "明察秋毫"}, {"start": 759.93, "end": 760.93, "text": "我不如你"}, {"start": 761.93, "end": 762.93, "text": "若论琴艺"}, {"start": 763.93, "end": 765.93, "text": "你比我差远了"}, {"start": 768.93, "end": 810.54, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 811.54, "end": 812.54, "text": "说 直说"}, {"start": 813.54, "end": 814.54, "text": "恕卑职无能"}, {"start": 815.54, "end": 816.54, "text": "少公子"}, {"start": 816.54, "end": 818.54, "text": "已是命悬一线了"}, {"start": 820.54, "end": 821.54, "text": "你就一点办法"}, {"start": 821.54, "end": 822.54, "text": "都没有了吗"}, {"start": 822.54, "end": 823.54, "text": "丞相恕罪"}, {"start": 824.54, "end": 826.54, "text": "卑职不敢欺瞒丞相"}, {"start": 827.54, "end": 828.54, "text": "少公子"}, {"start": 828.54, "end": 829.54, "text": "身中剧毒"}, {"start": 829.54, "end": 831.54, "text": "且剧毒已攻入心脉"}, {"start": 832.54, "end": 833.54, "text": "即便是丞相"}, {"start": 833.54, "end": 835.54, "text": "杀了卑职"}, {"start": 835.54, "end": 836.54, "text": "卑职也依然是"}, {"start": 836.54, "end": 838.54, "text": "无能为力"}, {"start": 839.54, "end": 840.54, "text": "滚出去"}, {"start": 841.54, "end": 842.54, "text": "谢丞相"}, {"start": 842.54, "end": 870.26, "text": "你看这个"}, {"start": 870.26, "end": 872.66, "text": "这是毒树"}, {"start": 872.66, "end": 880.58, "text": "想不到这天底下"}, {"start": 880.58, "end": 882.58, "text": "还真有毒树"}, {"start": 883.58, "end": 884.58, "text": "吓人来报"}, {"start": 884.58, "end": 885.58, "text": "前院有只猫"}, {"start": 885.58, "end": 887.58, "text": "也是中毒死的"}, {"start": 887.58, "end": 888.58, "text": "在猫的腹里"}, {"start": 888.58, "end": 890.58, "text": "也发现了一只毒树"}, {"start": 891.58, "end": 892.58, "text": "天下万物"}, {"start": 892.58, "end": 893.58, "text": "无奇不有"}, {"start": 894.58, "end": 895.58, "text": "可他为何偏偏"}, {"start": 895.58, "end": 896.58, "text": "就要冲儿"}, {"start": 896.58, "end": 897.58, "text": "为何"}, {"start": 897.58, "end": 902.55, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 903.55, "end": 904.55, "text": "在下有句话"}, {"start": 904.55, "end": 905.55, "text": "如果说错了"}, {"start": 906.55, "end": 907.55, "text": "请丞相"}, {"start": 907.55, "end": 909.55, "text": "切勿犟罪"}, {"start": 909.55, "end": 910.55, "text": "说"}, {"start": 910.55, "end": 924.32, "text": "说"}, {"start": 924.32, "end": 928.07, "text": "我看了少公子"}, {"start": 928.07, "end": 929.07, "text": "腿上的毒痕"}, {"start": 930.07, "end": 931.07, "text": "不是毒树咬的"}, {"start": 933.07, "end": 934.07, "text": "是蛇咬的"}, {"start": 935.07, "end": 936.07, "text": "何以见得"}, {"start": 937.07, "end": 939.42, "text": "我幼年时"}, {"start": 939.42, "end": 941.42, "text": "住在竹林之下"}, {"start": 942.42, "end": 943.42, "text": "村里常有人"}, {"start": 944.42, "end": 945.42, "text": "被蛇咬伤"}, {"start": 946.42, "end": 947.42, "text": "像这样的毒痕"}, {"start": 947.42, "end": 949.42, "text": "我一眼便能认出来"}, {"start": 949.42, "end": 950.42, "text": "那册页上"}, {"start": 950.42, "end": 952.42, "text": "为何会有鼠式痕迹"}, {"start": 952.42, "end": 953.42, "text": "假象"}, {"start": 953.42, "end": 954.42, "text": "假象"}, {"start": 954.42, "end": 955.42, "text": "那真相是什么"}, {"start": 959.49, "end": 960.49, "text": "毒蛇咬的"}, {"start": 961.49, "end": 963.49, "text": "相府地势甚高"}, {"start": 963.49, "end": 964.49, "text": "冲儿的屋子"}, {"start": 964.49, "end": 965.49, "text": "又十分干燥"}, {"start": 965.49, "end": 967.49, "text": "怎么会有蛇出没"}, {"start": 967.49, "end": 969.49, "text": "蛇自己不会进"}, {"start": 970.49, "end": 972.49, "text": "可要是人呢"}, {"start": 972.49, "end": 973.49, "text": "弦月"}, {"start": 973.49, "end": 986.33, "text": "你估计"}, {"start": 989.15, "end": 995.21, "text": "你是不知道"}, {"start": 995.21, "end": 996.21, "text": "还是不敢说"}, {"start": 996.21, "end": 997.21, "text": "丞相在下"}, {"start": 998.21, "end": 1000.21, "text": "在下真的不敢"}, {"start": 1000.21, "end": 1001.21, "text": "妄自猜测"}, {"start": 1001.21, "end": 1003.21, "text": "今天我偏要你猜"}, {"start": 1003.21, "end": 1004.21, "text": "我要你说"}, {"start": 1004.21, "end": 1005.21, "text": "我要你说出心中念头"}, {"start": 1005.21, "end": 1006.21, "text": "说什么都无罪"}, {"start": 1006.21, "end": 1007.21, "text": "你要不说我就杀你"}, {"start": 1008.21, "end": 1023.1, "text": "丞相请不要逼我"}, {"start": 1023.1, "end": 1032.17, "text": "说"}, {"start": 1032.17, "end": 1037.78, "text": "谁是杀人凶手"}, {"start": 1038.78, "end": 1039.78, "text": "首先判断那人之死"}, {"start": 1040.78, "end": 1041.78, "text": "对谁最有利"}, {"start": 1041.78, "end": 1042.78, "text": "说得好"}, {"start": 1042.78, "end": 1043.78, "text": "接着说"}, {"start": 1043.78, "end": 1045.78, "text": "丞相请不要逼我"}, {"start": 1045.78, "end": 1070.74, "text": "努力曹皮为世子"}, {"start": 1071.74, "end": 1088.2, "text": "丞相不好了"}, {"start": 1088.2, "end": 1089.2, "text": "怎么了"}, {"start": 1090.2, "end": 1091.2, "text": "皮公子"}, {"start": 1091.2, "end": 1092.2, "text": "皮公子也被毒蛇咬了"}, {"start": 1092.2, "end": 1093.2, "text": "人是不行"}, {"start": 1093.2, "end": 1094.2, "text": "危在旦夕"}, {"start": 1094.2, "end": 1100.32, "text": "谁"}, {"start": 1100.32, "end": 1102.95, "text": "皮公子"}, {"start": 1102.95, "end": 1174.96, "text": "还没事"}, {"start": 1174.96, "end": 1179.64, "text": "三弟四弟"}, {"start": 1180.64, "end": 1181.64, "text": "他们没事吧"}, {"start": 1182.64, "end": 1183.64, "text": "他们也很好"}, {"start": 1183.64, "end": 1184.64, "text": "都太平"}, {"start": 1184.64, "end": 1229.86, "text": "曹芝和曹章呢"}, {"start": 1231.86, "end": 1232.86, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1232.86, "end": 1233.86, "text": "小的早就去过了"}, {"start": 1233.86, "end": 1234.86, "text": "三公子外出涉猎"}, {"start": 1234.86, "end": 1235.86, "text": "不在府上"}, {"start": 1235.86, "end": 1236.86, "text": "四公子昨夜和文友们"}, {"start": 1236.86, "end": 1237.86, "text": "赴食饮酒"}, {"start": 1237.86, "end": 1238.86, "text": "此事大罪不喜"}, {"start": 1238.86, "end": 1239.86, "text": "畜生"}, {"start": 1239.86, "end": 1240.86, "text": "报来"}, {"start": 1240.86, "end": 1241.86, "text": "诺"}, {"start": 1241.86, "end": 1243.86, "text": "报"}, {"start": 1243.86, "end": 1244.86, "text": "毕丞相"}, {"start": 1244.86, "end": 1245.86, "text": "少公子他"}, {"start": 1245.86, "end": 1246.86, "text": "初二怎么了"}, {"start": 1246.86, "end": 1247.86, "text": "毕丞相"}, {"start": 1247.86, "end": 1248.86, "text": "少公子他"}, {"start": 1248.86, "end": 1249.86, "text": "他快不行了"}, {"start": 1250.86, "end": 1310.01, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1311.01, "end": 1312.01, "text": "二公子"}, {"start": 1312.01, "end": 1313.01, "text": "二公子他不行了"}, {"start": 1313.01, "end": 1316.54, "text": "什么"}, {"start": 1317.54, "end": 1318.54, "text": "气息时有时无"}, {"start": 1318.54, "end": 1319.54, "text": "医官说"}, {"start": 1320.54, "end": 1321.54, "text": "只怕熬不过今夜了"}, {"start": 1329.86, "end": 1330.86, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1330.86, "end": 1331.86, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1331.86, "end": 1332.86, "text": "丞相慢点"}, {"start": 1332.86, "end": 1333.86, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1333.86, "end": 1334.86, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1334.86, "end": 1335.86, "text": "慢点"}, {"start": 1335.86, "end": 1374.56, "text": "丞相慢点"}, {"start": 1374.56, "end": 1375.56, "text": "二公子"}, {"start": 1375.56, "end": 1376.56, "text": "似有复苏之想"}, {"start": 1379.45, "end": 1380.45, "text": "说"}, {"start": 1380.45, "end": 1381.45, "text": "脉象健顺"}, {"start": 1381.45, "end": 1382.45, "text": "气息稍旺"}, {"start": 1383.45, "end": 1384.45, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 1384.45, "end": 1386.45, "text": "二公子八成是有救了"}, {"start": 1387.45, "end": 1388.45, "text": "真的"}, {"start": 1388.45, "end": 1389.45, "text": "当然有救"}, {"start": 1389.45, "end": 1391.45, "text": "在下恭喜丞相了"}, {"start": 1391.45, "end": 1424.26, "text": "少公子死了"}, {"start": 1424.26, "end": 1427.76, "text": "二公子康复了"}, {"start": 1428.76, "end": 1429.76, "text": "仲大"}, {"start": 1430.76, "end": 1431.76, "text": "你说"}, {"start": 1432.76, "end": 1434.76, "text": "是谁谋害了少公子"}, {"start": 1435.76, "end": 1440.12, "text": "为何要说谋害"}, {"start": 1441.12, "end": 1443.37, "text": "人各有命"}, {"start": 1443.37, "end": 1444.37, "text": "生死在天"}, {"start": 1445.37, "end": 1448.7, "text": "相府流言"}, {"start": 1450.7, "end": 1452.7, "text": "说少公子是被人谋害的"}, {"start": 1453.7, "end": 1456.02, "text": "贤兄可知"}, {"start": 1456.02, "end": 1457.02, "text": "流言也能杀人哪"}, {"start": 1459.02, "end": 1460.02, "text": "杀起人来"}, {"start": 1460.02, "end": 1461.02, "text": "比刀锋还快"}, {"start": 1463.36, "end": 1464.36, "text": "不错"}, {"start": 1465.36, "end": 1466.36, "text": "但是流言不止"}, {"start": 1467.36, "end": 1469.36, "text": "岂不还会再杀人"}, {"start": 1470.36, "end": 1471.36, "text": "这话贤兄说得对"}, {"start": 1479.11, "end": 1480.11, "text": "依你说"}, {"start": 1481.11, "end": 1483.11, "text": "是谁谋害了少公子"}, {"start": 1494.48, "end": 1495.48, "text": "依我看"}, {"start": 1495.48, "end": 1497.48, "text": "少公子自己害了自己"}, {"start": 1498.48, "end": 1500.48, "text": "此话怎么说"}, {"start": 1508.01, "end": 1509.01, "text": "少公子的聪明"}, {"start": 1509.01, "end": 1510.01, "text": "超过了所有兄长"}, {"start": 1512.01, "end": 1513.01, "text": "得到的恩诚"}, {"start": 1513.01, "end": 1514.01, "text": "也超过了所有兄长"}, {"start": 1515.01, "end": 1516.01, "text": "所以他早晚必死"}, {"start": 1517.01, "end": 1545.18, "text": "儿不知冲弟被鼠咬了"}, {"start": 1546.18, "end": 1547.18, "text": "儿有罪"}, {"start": 1548.18, "end": 1549.18, "text": "儿有罪"}, {"start": 1549.18, "end": 1552.81, "text": "儿头晚"}, {"start": 1552.81, "end": 1553.81, "text": "饮酒过了"}, {"start": 1554.81, "end": 1556.81, "text": "齐庆父亲降罪"}, {"start": 1556.81, "end": 1591.31, "text": "酒作乐"}, {"start": 1591.31, "end": 1596.8, "text": "涉猎饮食"}, {"start": 1596.8, "end": 1600.04, "text": "畜生"}, {"start": 1600.04, "end": 1601.04, "text": "畜生"}, {"start": 1603.04, "end": 1604.04, "text": "听着"}, {"start": 1604.04, "end": 1605.04, "text": "你们要为冲儿"}, {"start": 1609.5, "end": 1610.5, "text": "守令三日"}, {"start": 1612.5, "end": 1614.5, "text": "好好想想自个儿的罪过"}, {"start": 1614.5, "end": 1631.18, "text": "冲弟"}, {"start": 1632.18, "end": 1633.18, "text": "冲弟"}, {"start": 1633.18, "end": 1655.42, "text": "你怎么就走了呢"}, {"start": 1655.42, "end": 1658.09, "text": "为什么"}, {"start": 1659.09, "end": 1661.09, "text": "为什么不让哥替你去死"}, {"start": 1677.07, "end": 1678.07, "text": "皮儿"}, {"start": 1678.07, "end": 1680.38, "text": "爷爷身体不好"}, {"start": 1681.38, "end": 1682.38, "text": "回去歇着吧"}, {"start": 1682.38, "end": 1696.12, "text": "我要陪了三弟"}, {"start": 1697.12, "end": 1698.12, "text": "四弟"}, {"start": 1699.12, "end": 1700.12, "text": "给冲弟守令"}, {"start": 1701.12, "end": 1756.3, "text": "我原本想把冲儿托付给你"}, {"start": 1757.3, "end": 1761.26, "text": "可惜天不遂人愿哪"}, {"start": 1761.26, "end": 1766.68, "text": "冲儿三天是福"}, {"start": 1767.68, "end": 1768.68, "text": "少公子不幸"}, {"start": 1768.68, "end": 1769.68, "text": "就是在下不幸"}, {"start": 1769.68, "end": 1770.68, "text": "冲儿虽然不在了"}, {"start": 1772.68, "end": 1773.68, "text": "但我还是想用你"}, {"start": 1775.68, "end": 1776.68, "text": "这样吧"}, {"start": 1777.68, "end": 1780.68, "text": "你再从其他公子里选一个"}, {"start": 1781.68, "end": 1785.98, "text": "禀丞相"}, {"start": 1786.98, "end": 1788.98, "text": "在下虽然和少公子"}, {"start": 1788.98, "end": 1789.98, "text": "只相处了三天"}, {"start": 1790.98, "end": 1792.98, "text": "但却深深为他的睿智"}, {"start": 1792.98, "end": 1793.98, "text": "所折服"}, {"start": 1793.98, "end": 1797.61, "text": "在下想在少公子灵派"}, {"start": 1797.61, "end": 1798.61, "text": "扎入而居"}, {"start": 1798.61, "end": 1799.61, "text": "为他守令三年"}, {"start": 1800.61, "end": 1807.22, "text": "你只做了他三天师父"}, {"start": 1807.22, "end": 1810.66, "text": "却要为他守令三年"}, {"start": 1811.66, "end": 1813.66, "text": "未免少公子泉下孤寂"}, {"start": 1815.66, "end": 1816.66, "text": "在下愿陪他三年"}, {"start": 1818.66, "end": 1819.66, "text": "每月初一十五"}, {"start": 1819.66, "end": 1821.66, "text": "为他焚化些书籍册业"}, {"start": 1821.66, "end": 1823.66, "text": "将写十文一礼"}, {"start": 1823.66, "end": 1825.66, "text": "我也算是少公子"}, {"start": 1825.66, "end": 1826.66, "text": "羊间牧兵吧"}, {"start": 1826.66, "end": 1830.32, "text": "请丞相恩准我们"}, {"start": 1830.32, "end": 1832.32, "text": "师生间三年缘分"}, {"start": 1832.32, "end": 1833.32, "text": "好"}, {"start": 1833.32, "end": 1836.85, "text": "多谢了"}, {"start": 1836.85, "end": 1844.0, "text": "那我还是要任命你为主部"}, {"start": 1845.0, "end": 1846.0, "text": "以后"}, {"start": 1847.0, "end": 1848.0, "text": "以后"}, {"start": 1848.0, "end": 1850.0, "text": "可以到府上来议事"}, {"start": 1852.0, "end": 1853.0, "text": "三年后"}, {"start": 1853.0, "end": 1859.63, "text": "三年后"}, {"start": 1861.63, "end": 1862.63, "text": "再说吧"}, {"start": 1862.63, "end": 1894.1, "text": "几经天了"}, {"start": 1895.1, "end": 1896.1, "text": "四更刚过"}, {"start": 1897.1, "end": 1901.49, "text": "冲儿死了"}, {"start": 1904.76, "end": 1905.76, "text": "霹儿侥幸生还"}, {"start": 1906.76, "end": 1910.96, "text": "现在看起来"}, {"start": 1911.96, "end": 1914.21, "text": "谁最想让他们死"}, {"start": 1916.21, "end": 1918.21, "text": "他们死了对谁最有利"}, {"start": 1919.21, "end": 1920.21, "text": "谁"}, {"start": 1921.21, "end": 1922.21, "text": "最有可能"}, {"start": 1922.21, "end": 1923.21, "text": "做世子"}, {"start": 1923.21, "end": 1925.21, "text": "继承我的大位"}, {"start": 1925.21, "end": 1927.81, "text": "曹植"}, {"start": 1929.81, "end": 1930.81, "text": "还是曹长"}, {"start": 1930.81, "end": 1935.97, "text": "你怎么不说话呀"}, {"start": 1936.97, "end": 1938.97, "text": "在下已经错过一次"}, {"start": 1939.97, "end": 1941.97, "text": "不敢再妄自猜测了"}, {"start": 1942.97, "end": 1943.97, "text": "都布置好了吗"}, {"start": 1944.97, "end": 1946.97, "text": "按蒋丞相的吩咐"}, {"start": 1947.97, "end": 1948.97, "text": "我一切都布置好了"}, {"start": 1949.97, "end": 1953.24, "text": "说我听听"}, {"start": 1954.24, "end": 1955.24, "text": "每个公子的住宅"}, {"start": 1955.24, "end": 1956.24, "text": "都发了扑手的梦"}, {"start": 1957.24, "end": 1959.78, "text": "屋子都安排了耳目"}, {"start": 1960.78, "end": 1961.78, "text": "巷府内外"}, {"start": 1961.78, "end": 1962.78, "text": "每个时辰"}, {"start": 1963.78, "end": 1964.78, "text": "都有人暗查"}, {"start": 1965.78, "end": 1966.78, "text": "每个角落里"}, {"start": 1967.78, "end": 1968.78, "text": "都有人监视"}, {"start": 1969.78, "end": 1970.78, "text": "灵堂呢"}, {"start": 1970.78, "end": 1971.78, "text": "没有灵堂"}, {"start": 1975.37, "end": 1976.37, "text": "没有安排耳目"}, {"start": 1977.37, "end": 1982.02, "text": "那人容易"}, {"start": 1982.02, "end": 1984.02, "text": "露出刑记"}, {"start": 1984.02, "end": 1988.86, "text": "三天三夜下来"}, {"start": 1989.86, "end": 1993.81, "text": "无罪者肯定困得只打瞌睡"}, {"start": 1994.81, "end": 1995.81, "text": "有罪的人"}, {"start": 1996.81, "end": 1997.81, "text": "做贼的人"}, {"start": 2000.09, "end": 2001.09, "text": "对心虚"}, {"start": 2002.09, "end": 2003.09, "text": "定然是如坐阵阵"}, {"start": 2006.71, "end": 2007.71, "text": "时辰差不多了"}, {"start": 2007.71, "end": 2008.71, "text": "你去看看吧"}, {"start": 2012.27, "end": 2013.27, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 2014.27, "end": 2015.27, "text": "我还是不去的好"}, {"start": 2015.27, "end": 2022.61, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 2023.61, "end": 2025.61, "text": "在下不想知道这人是谁"}, {"start": 2026.61, "end": 2027.61, "text": "永远不想知道"}, {"start": 2027.61, "end": 2046.53, "text": "谢丞相"}, {"start": 2046.53, "end": 2164.07, "text": "你听仔细了"}, {"start": 2167.92, "end": 2168.92, "text": "我现在说的话"}, {"start": 2168.92, "end": 2169.92, "text": "你要终生牢记"}, {"start": 2170.92, "end": 2171.92, "text": "永远遵从"}, {"start": 2178.01, "end": 2184.26, "text": "冲儿"}, {"start": 2184.26, "end": 2187.26, "text": "冲儿是被毒鼠所伤"}, {"start": 2188.26, "end": 2189.26, "text": "曹辟也是"}, {"start": 2190.26, "end": 2192.26, "text": "相府里没有任何奸贼"}, {"start": 2194.26, "end": 2196.26, "text": "我的所有的儿子"}, {"start": 2197.26, "end": 2199.26, "text": "个个都相亲相爱"}, {"start": 2200.26, "end": 2202.26, "text": "亲密无间"}, {"start": 2202.26, "end": 2215.38, "text": "还有"}, {"start": 2215.38, "end": 2218.59, "text": "我要你忘掉此事"}, {"start": 2220.59, "end": 2222.59, "text": "永远也不准再提起"}, {"start": 2222.59, "end": 2225.13, "text": "日后"}, {"start": 2225.13, "end": 2228.13, "text": "如果有人敢妄自猜测"}, {"start": 2228.13, "end": 2230.13, "text": "不管他是谁"}, {"start": 2230.13, "end": 2232.13, "text": "你都可以先斩后奏"}, {"start": 2232.13, "end": 2233.13, "text": "遵命"}, {"start": 2233.13, "end": 2238.45, "text": "真的要在这里"}, {"start": 2238.45, "end": 2318.46, "text": "受令三年吗"}, {"start": 2320.46, "end": 2321.46, "text": "那三年之后"}, {"start": 2325.43, "end": 2326.43, "text": "先生"}, {"start": 2326.43, "end": 2328.43, "text": "愿意做我的师父吗"}, {"start": 2329.43, "end": 2330.43, "text": "这事问我无用"}, {"start": 2331.43, "end": 2333.43, "text": "公子应该请示丞相"}, {"start": 2334.43, "end": 2335.43, "text": "我问过了"}, {"start": 2336.43, "end": 2337.43, "text": "丞相"}, {"start": 2338.43, "end": 2339.43, "text": "准了"}, {"start": 2339.43, "end": 2340.43, "text": "仲达"}, {"start": 2341.43, "end": 2375.26, "text": "如果我没猜错"}, {"start": 2378.02, "end": 2379.02, "text": "这是你为曹冲的"}, {"start": 2379.02, "end": 2382.02, "text": "这是你为曹冲写的祭诗吧"}, {"start": 2384.02, "end": 2385.02, "text": "如果我猜得不错"}, {"start": 2387.02, "end": 2389.02, "text": "熊台是奉丞相旨意"}, {"start": 2389.02, "end": 2390.02, "text": "来打探我吧"}, {"start": 2390.02, "end": 2393.58, "text": "不错"}, {"start": 2394.58, "end": 2396.58, "text": "丞相一直不相信"}, {"start": 2397.58, "end": 2399.58, "text": "你会为曹冲守令三年"}, {"start": 2401.58, "end": 2402.58, "text": "丞相错了"}, {"start": 2402.58, "end": 2414.63, "text": "我相信你会的"}, {"start": 2415.63, "end": 2416.63, "text": "仲达"}, {"start": 2416.63, "end": 2418.63, "text": "你知道我为什么相信你吗"}, {"start": 2419.63, "end": 2420.63, "text": "请辞教"}, {"start": 2420.63, "end": 2425.9, "text": "丞相最钟爱的公子死了"}, {"start": 2426.9, "end": 2427.9, "text": "世子大位"}, {"start": 2427.9, "end": 2428.9, "text": "亦是难以决定"}, {"start": 2429.9, "end": 2430.9, "text": "你虽聪明"}, {"start": 2432.9, "end": 2434.9, "text": "但此刻也不知该做谁的师父"}, {"start": 2436.9, "end": 2437.9, "text": "所以你想花三年的时间"}, {"start": 2437.9, "end": 2439.9, "text": "观察与等待"}, {"start": 2439.9, "end": 2445.78, "text": "于兄钦佩你的奸人"}]